4Nvnan12gYA&oe=69D789D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "1763608794160777", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982639_1763608797494110_9146144758691653845_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YaEWCZc_ZsoQ7kNvwELXSJu&_nc_oc=Adr56v21o-LZzviOB1NtxjEngxry4oQnyjVNlETxr3YmDkFo-vuVuZfvLcnnzl2_wR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1868oNO7AQv9WTJOix7eGbHpI38haJ4TCTOqdcaDJsiw&oe=69D7897A"}, "display_name": "CitrusBall", "keywords": [], "long_description": "From one backyard court to world-wide phenomenon, CitrusBall is the new sport everyone's talking about. Now the game\u2019s greatest are joining an exclusive tournament on a billionaire\u2019s mysterious private island. Who will be crowned as champion?\n\nIn CitrusBall, you select a powerful character with unique abilities to face off in a designed-for-VR sport inspired by tennis and pickleball.\n\nEarly access features:\n3 playable characters, each with a unique talent, special move, and \"game changer\"\n2 island locations to play single matches against a computer-controlled opponent\nTutorial covering basic gameplay and ability usage\n\nFuture roadmap:\n3 additional playable characters\nStory mode with new locations culminating in a boss battle\nMultiplayer", "short_description": "From one backyard court to world-wide phenomenon, CitrusBall is the new sport everyone's talking about. Now the game\u2019s greatest are joining an exclusive tournament on a billionaire\u2019s mysterious private island. Who will be crowned as champion?\n\nIn CitrusBall, you select a powerful character with unique abilities to face off in a designed-for-VR sport inspired by tennis and pickleball."}]}, "developer_name": "Smaller Steps", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citrusballgame.com/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Smaller Steps", "support_website_url": null, "website